{
  "entry": "start",
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh, wow...",
        "I've seen this beach from the water before, but...",
        "It's a lot different being up here.",
        "The sand feels so strange under my feet."
      ],
      "next": "choice_1"
    },
    "choice_1": {
      "lines": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Well, I think you look pretty cute standing on it.",
          "date_style": "bold",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_1_bold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Aren't you always burying yourself in the sand?",
          "date_style": "playful",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_1_playful"
        },
        {
          "text": "We can stay closer to the water if you want.",
          "date_style": "reassure",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_1_reassure"
        }
      ]
    },
    "reaction_1_bold": {
      "lines": [
        "O-oh! Um... thank you.",
        "I guess having legs isn't so bad..."
      ],
      "next": "choice_2"
    },
    "reaction_1_playful": {
      "lines": [
        "Th-that's different!",
        "I'm usually in the sand, not standing on it!",
        "And I didn't have feet before..."
      ],
      "next": "choice_2"
    },
    "reaction_1_reassure": {
      "lines": [
        "No, it's okay!",
        "I want to see more of it."
      ],
      "next": "choice_2"
    },
    "choice_2": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh! Look at this!",
        "I used to see shells like these all the time underwater.",
        "They look so different in the sunlight...",
        "Do people just... take these home?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I could keep one to remember our date.",
          "date_style": "bold",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_2_bold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Only the really expensive ones. That one's probably worth a fortune.",
          "date_style": "playful",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_2_playful"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeah! You should take it home if you like it.",
          "date_style": "reassure",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_2_reassure"
        }
      ]
    },
    "reaction_2_bold": {
      "lines": [
        "Really?",
        "Then... I think I want one too."
      ],
      "next": "choice_3"
    },
    "reaction_2_playful": {
      "lines": [
        "W-what? Really?",
        "...You're messing with me, aren't you?"
      ],
      "next": "choice_3"
    },
    "reaction_2_reassure": {
      "lines": [
        "I think I will!",
        "Maybe I'll put it by my window."
      ],
      "next": "choice_3"
    },
    "choice_3": {
      "lines": [
        "You know...",
        "When I first came up here, I thought I'd just look around for a little while.",
        "I didn't really think I'd end up staying.",
        "And now I've got a house, and all this stuff, and...",
        "Well, you."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'm pretty glad you stayed. It makes taking you on dates a lot easier.",
          "date_style": "bold",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_3_bold"
        },
        {
          "text": "And here I thought you only stayed for the spyglass.",
          "date_style": "playful",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_3_playful"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm really happy you're here, Silas.",
          "date_style": "reassure",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_3_reassure"
        }
      ]
    },
    "reaction_3_bold": {
      "lines": [
        "Hehe... yeah.",
        "I'm glad I stayed too."
      ],
      "next": "choice_4"
    },
    "reaction_3_playful": {
      "lines": [
        "Well, the spyglass is pretty great...",
        "But I guess there are some other reasons too."
      ],
      "next": "choice_4"
    },
    "reaction_3_reassure": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh...",
        "That means a lot, Penni.",
        "I'm really happy too."
      ],
      "next": "choice_4"
    },
    "choice_4": {
      "lines": [
        "Can we sit down for a little bit?",
        "I used to watch people sitting on the beach all the time.",
        "I never really understood what they were doing...",
        "But I think I'm starting to get it."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "You can lean on me if you want.",
          "date_style": "bold",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_4_bold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at you. You're becoming a real beach person.",
          "date_style": "playful",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_4_playful"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes it's nice to just sit and do nothing.",
          "date_style": "reassure",
          "grey_when_picked": false,
          "next": "reaction_4_reassure"
        }
      ]
    },
    "reaction_4_bold": {
      "lines": [
        "O-oh! Really?",
        "Um... okay.",
        "This is nice..."
      ],
      "next": "ending"
    },
    "reaction_4_playful": {
      "lines": [
        "A beach person?",
        "Hehe... I guess I am!",
        "That's a little weird to think about."
      ],
      "next": "ending"
    },
    "reaction_4_reassure": {
      "lines": [
        "Yeah...",
        "I think I like that.",
        "Especially when I'm not alone."
      ],
      "next": "ending"
    },
    "ending": {
      "lines": [
        "Hey, Penni?",
        "Thanks for bringing me here.",
        "I know it's just the beach, but...",
        "I had a really nice time with you.",
        "Maybe we can come back again sometime?",
        {
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "I'd like that."
        }
      ]
    }
  }
